<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ralcorp said downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ralcorp said downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber lowered is recommendation on Ralcorp Holdings Inc to neutral from attractive, according to a source at PaineWebber.</p>
<p>-- Shares were unchanged at 21-1/4 in morning New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
</text>
